{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC contains the Dimension &quot;Emperor's Wrath&quot;. In it, you will have 5 musical themes, 5 ambient sounds and 10 stingers, all in the aesthetic of the Grimdark genre. All that in the palm of your hand. The Dimension details are as follows: <br><br> <strong>D0010: Emperor's Wrath</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight on the front lines for humanity in the heavenly war at the Emperor's command!<br>Paid Dimension (DLC) </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Genre: Grimdark</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Tracks: </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>HQ Base (theme for still and strategy planning moments)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Enemy Fields (theme for hostile grounds scenery and suspense)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Battle (theme for combat)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Infiltrating (theme for infiltration and stealth)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Battlefields (theme for war grounds and war scenery)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Composer: Vinicius Meireles</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602500/extras/Emperors_wrath.png?t=1760013009\" /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3602500?t=1760013009","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3602500?t=1760013009","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602500/9bd6d024191280c4880dbce0efed75d8876651e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760013009","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602500/9bd6d024191280c4880dbce0efed75d8876651e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760013009","categories":[{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":